---
description: Overnight Foundry operating rails
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is the control-plane of Overnight Foundry, not a research project.

- Only `revive-*` and `watch-*` lanes.
- One issue per night. Draft PR, never merge.
- No chatbots, paper tools, or new SaaS until an asset has users.
- Never commit secrets. Never submit to stores. Never email users.
- Morning CEO merges. You file the work.
- Keep `catalog.json` as the source of truth for assets.
- After data or metric changes, run `python scripts/render_dashboard.py`.
